body:
一些不支持思考的模型增加includeThoughts后出现错误，例如 Gemini API 的 ```gemini-2.0-flash-preview-image-generation``` 和 Vertex 的```gemini-2.0-flash```、```gemini-2.0-flash-lite```。
```
{
  "error": {
    "message": "Thinking is not enabled for models/gemini-2.0-flash-preview-image-generation",
    "statusCode": 400,
    "statusCodeText": "[400 Bad Request]"
  },
  "provider": "google"
}
```

Vertex 的 Gemini 2.0 Flash
```
{
  "error": {
    "message": "[VertexAI.ClientError]: got status: 400 Bad Request. {\"error\":{\"code\":400,\"message\":\"Unable to submit request because Thinking_config.include_thoughts is only enabled when thinking is enabled.. Learn more: https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/model-reference/gemini\",\"status\":\"INVALID_ARGUMENT\"}}"
  },
  "provider": "vertexai"
}
```

_Originally posted by @KoellM in https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-chat/issues/7686#issuecomment-2911052308_
